   "no": 11,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "十八日發　　　樹蔭生",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000012",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 12,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "十六日夜は渡良瀬河畔に父老と語り明かしつ、明けの日も爲めにいたく時をうつしぬ、堤上の茂竹枯れて春は來ぬれど鶯も鳴かずなど訴ふるを聽て",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000013",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 13,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "鶯も鳴かずなりぬる里人は",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000014",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 14,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "なにをしるしに春は知るらん",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000015",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 15,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "佐野の停車場に滊車を待ちぬるに山風に雪の降り來ぬれば",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000016",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 16,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "袖さへに拂はでむかし忍ぶかな",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000017",
   "pid": "",
   "pages": [],
   "no": 17,
   "vol": "雪中の日光より",
   "kotobagaki": "",
   "author": "",
   "text": "佐野のわたりの雪の夕暮",
   "sachu": "",
   "poems": [],
   "notes": [],
   "lb": [],
   "form": "prose"
  },
  {
   "id": "kinoshita-naoe-6ad1c2eb-000018",
